.TH BBCAT-THUMBNAILER 1 "July 2026" "bbcat-gnome" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bbcat-thumbnailer \- create thumbnails for ANSI and BBS artwork
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bbcat-thumbnailer
.I INPUT OUTPUT SIZE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bbcat-thumbnailer
renders supported ANSI and BBS artwork as a square PNG thumbnail for
freedesktop-compatible file managers.
It is normally invoked automatically by GNOME Files.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I INPUT
Artwork file to render.
.TP
.I OUTPUT
PNG thumbnail path to create.
.TP
.I SIZE
Maximum thumbnail width and height in pixels.
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/EriksRemess/bbcat-thumbnailer
